  "description": "Spicers is a subculture in Ireland, primarily located around Dublin, Ireland during the late 2000s to the early 2010s. It is characterized by Adidas tracksuits, elaborate mullets, neon/tacky outfits, dubstep, and an online life that was based on social media platforms such as Bebo. The Spicer style appearance was distinct, loud, and instantly recognizable in suburban areas such as Swords, Lucan, Malahide, and Raheny.",
